rned from Week 7."},{"league":"NFL","headline":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba, stifling defense help Seahawks hand Chiefs first loss","desc":"Seattle's bread and butter from its Super Bowl championship season -- Jaxon Smith-Njigba and defense -- was too much for the Chiefs."},{"league":"NHL","headline":"O'Reilly, Stamkos each score twice as the Predators beat the Avalanche 6-2","desc":"\u2014 Ryan O\u2019Reilly had two goals and two assists, Steven Stamkos added two goals and an assist and the Nashville Predators beat the Colorado Avalanche 6-2 on Sunday night."},{"league":"NHL","headline":"Who has scored the most goals in NHL history?","desc":"Alex Ovechkin holds the record for the most individual career goals in NHL history. Which other players are at the top of the list?"},{"league":"MLB","headline":"RHP Quinn Priester's uncle pilots Brewers' flight to Florida","desc":"\"Hey, thanks, guys. I didn't know Quinn threw a knuckleball,\" Brewers manager Pat Murphy quipped after the plane encountered a little turbulence upon landing."},{"league":"College Football","headline":"QB recruit Bo Bryan, son of country star Luke Bryan, commits to Georgia","desc":"Class of 2027 quarterback Bo Bryan, the son of country music star Luke Bryan, announced his commitment to Georgia on Sunday."},{"league":"College Football","headline":"Gamecocks fined $500K after fans rush field in win over Vols","desc":"The Southeastern Conference fined South Carolina $500,000 on Sunday for allowing fans to storm the field following a 27-24 victory over then-No. 11 Tennessee."},{"league":"College Football","headline":"Sources: Texas' Trevor Goosby has season-ending knee injury","desc":"Texas star left tackle Trevor Goosby will miss the rest of the season after suffering a knee injury vs. Ole Miss, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Sunday."},{"league":"College Football","headline":"Missouri RB Ahmad Hardy to practice for first time since getting shot","desc":"Missouri consensus All-America RB Ahmad Hardy, who wa